# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in. electron-vite reads these at
# build time and writes them into the main process's bundle, so a packaged
# app carries them; a shell variable of the same name works too.

# The Application (client) ID of Kisa's app registration in Microsoft Entra:
# a public client for "Any Entra ID Tenant + Personal Microsoft accounts" with
# the redirect URI `http://localhost` (Mobile and desktop applications).
# Without it, Microsoft sign-in for Outlook accounts is not offered.
MAIN_VITE_MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=
